ntent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/loader/loader.svg\" alt=\"加载器\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/pyrotechnic-elytra/files?gameVersionTypeId=6\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/loader/neoforge.svg\" alt=\"NeoForge\"></a><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/separator.svg\" alt=\"分隔符\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/pyrotechnic-elytra/files?gameVersionTypeId=4\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/loader/fabric.svg\" alt=\"Fabric\"></a></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/side/server.svg\" alt=\"覆盖层\"></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/github/issues.svg\" alt=\"问题\"><a href=\"https://github.com/crystal-nest/pyrotechnic-elytra/issues\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/github/github.svg\" alt=\"GitHub\"></a></p><hr><h2><strong>描述</strong></h2><p>无论你飞向何方，都能为所有人创造一场烟花秀！<br>\n现在，任何颜色、效果或形状的烟花火箭都可以用来助推你的飞行！</p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/pyrotechnic-elytra/day-flight.gif\" alt=\"日间飞行\"><br>\n<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/pyrotechnic-elytra/night-flight.gif\" alt=\"夜间飞行\"></p><h2><strong>依赖项</strong></h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"text-align:left\">模组</th>\n<th style=\"text-align:center\">加载器</th>\n<th style=\"text-align:center\">要求</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cobweb\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Cobweb</a></td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\">全部</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\">必需</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table><h2><strong>许可证与使用权</strong></h2><p>欢迎将此模组模板用于任何模组，只需注明出处并可能链接至<a href=\"https://github.com/crystal-nest/pyrotechnic-elytra#readme\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">此处</a>。<br>\n本项目根据<a href=\"https://github.com/crystal-nest/pyrotechnic-elytra/blob/master/LICENSE\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Crystal Nest 社区许可证 v1</a>发布。</p><h2><strong>支持我们</strong></h2><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fcrystalnest.it%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img alt=\"Crystal Nest 网站\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/crystal-nest/pic512.png\" width=\"14.286%\"></a><a href=\"https://discord.gg/BP6EdBfAmt\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img alt=\"Discord\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/discord/discord512.png\" width=\"14.286%\"></a><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/crystalspider\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img alt=\"Patreon\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/patreon/patreon512.png\" width=\"14.286%\"></a><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fcrystalspider\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img alt=\"Ko-fi\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/kofi/kofi512.png\" width=\"14.286%\"></a><a href=\"https://github.com/Crystal-Nest\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img alt=\"我们的其他项目\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/github/github512.png\" width=\"14.286%\"></a><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252forganization%252fcrystal-nest\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img alt=\"Modrinth\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/modrinth/modrinth512.png\" width=\"14.286%\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/crystalspider/projects\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img alt=\"CurseForge\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/curseforge/curseforge512.png\" width=\"14.286%\"></a></p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%